OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FLargely cloudy at first,
OL,6,Falthough some brighter spells are
OL,7,Flikely during the afternoon. A few
OL,8,Fspots of light rain are possible where
OL,9,Fthe cloud thickens.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FA
OL,12,Fspell of rain is possible on Monday,
OL,13,Fbefore clearing to sunny spells and
OL,14,Fscattered showers on Tuesday and
OL,15,FWednesday. Temperatures around average
OL,16,Ffor the time of year.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
